# Build artifacts
/target

# cargo-mutants output (current run + rotated previous run)
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/

# Fixture crates are surveyed with `cargo metadata --no-deps`, which never
# writes a lockfile; a stray `cargo build` inside one must not dirty the
# tree either.
crates/*/tests/fixtures/**/Cargo.lock
crates/*/tests/fixtures/**/target/

# What `asbuilt render`, `export json` and `docs` write beside this repo's
# own model. SVGs vary with the Graphviz version and the site is a build
# artifact; only model.c4 and views.c4 are the source of truth.
/docs/architecture/views/
/docs/architecture/site/
/docs/architecture/model.json

# The landing-site crates are excluded from the workspace, so they build into
# their own target/ dirs; the site also emits dist/ (the dogfood build) and
# dist-snapshot/ (the deployed artifact) via Trunk. Their Cargo.lock is
# committed (they are apps). /gh/ is the gh-pages worktree the deploy
# assembles in CI. Receipts are written by the dogfood test and views/ holds
# the SVGs `asbuilt render` writes for the landing page; both directories
# keep a .gitkeep so Trunk's copy-dir works on a fresh checkout.
/crates/site/dist/
/crates/site/dist-snapshot/
/crates/site/target/
/crates/site-e2e/target/
/gh/
/crates/site/public/receipts/*
!/crates/site/public/receipts/.gitkeep
/crates/site/public/views/*
!/crates/site/public/views/.gitkeep
/crates/site/public/architecture/*
!/crates/site/public/architecture/.gitkeep

# Environment variables (secrets, config)
.env

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor files
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Agent skills installed with `npx skills add` (the skill of each tool this
# crate depends on). The pin lives in skills-lock.json, which is tracked;
# the content is fetched, so it is not vendored here. The Claude Code entry
# points are symlinks into .agents/, and a tracked symlink would dangle in
# any clone that has not run the install. A crate that uses its own shipped
# skill in-repo adds `!/.claude/skills/<name>` here and tracks that one
# symlink, whose target lives under skills/ (see SETUP.md).
/.agents/
/.claude/skills/
